# Getaway Barrel: "When this artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, reveal the top thirteen cards of your
# library. Put a random creature card from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a
# random order." Bot1 destroys its own Barrel with Abrade. The only creature among the top thirteen is a Memnite, the 13th
# card; the Ornithopter just beneath it, the 14th, is not revealed. So the Memnite enters, the other twelve revealed cards go
# to the bottom, and the Ornithopter is the new top card of the library, drawn on turn 3. Bot2's library is not touched.

